undry detergent, my skin itself."], [12.1, 13.64, "During the day, I was completely fine."], [13.86, 18.14, "Same house, same air, but the second I got under those covers, this deep itch would"], [18.14, 18.44, "start."], [18.66, 22.32, "Maybe 10 minutes in, and by 4 in the morning, I'd wake up already scratching."], [22.66, 25.14, "One night, I slept on the couch, just to test it."], [25.34, 27.74, "The itch didn't come, so I started reading."], [27.74, 30.34, "Dust mites burrow deep inside mattress foam."], [30.5, 32.58, "Deeper than washing or spraying can reach."], [32.82, 34.46, "I almost replaced the whole mattress."], [34.8, 36.3, "Then I found capture cards."], [36.54, 40.56, "They use a plant-derived lure that attracts mites up from deep inside the foam."], [40.76, 44.12, "They crawl onto the card, the adhesive holds them, and you throw the card away."], [44.36, 44.86, "Four cards."], [45.08, 46.06, "Four corners of your bed."], [46.28, 47.72, "Replace them every 90 days."], [48.02, 52.64, "No spraying your skin, no spraying the mattress, just a simple step to help manage the mites"], [52.64, 53.2, "where you sleep."], [53.38, 55.02, "See capture cards at the link below."], [55.02, 58.82, "There's a 90-day money-back guarantee, and you don't even need to return anything."]]}